# "Each opponent discards a card. For each opponent who can't, you draw a card" with two opponents: Bot2 emptied its hand on
# turn 2 (a land, five Moxen, Lotus Petal and Black Lotus, its drawn card included), Bot3 holds seven cards. Aclazotz
# attacks Bot3 on turn 4. Bot2 can't discard, so Bot1 draws exactly one card (one opponent, not both); Bot3 chooses its Mountain,
# a land card, so Bot1 also gets a Bat. In a game of more than two players the first player draws on its first turn
# (CR 103.8a). Bot1's hand: 8 cards after the turn-1 draw, 5 played (3 Swamps left), +1 turn-4 draw, +1 from Aclazotz = 5.
# Its library: 13 - 3 draws = 10.

